flowchart TD
    objectives[Research objectives] --> literature[Literature review]
    literature --> gaps[Identified research gaps]
    gaps --> dataset[Verified Mendeley source]
    dataset --> preprocessing[Leakage-safe preprocessing]
    preprocessing --> features[Feature engineering]
    features --> neural[Neural network]
    neural --> training[Model training]
    training --> evaluation[Evaluation]
    neural --> probability[Model probability]
    probability --> risk[Policy-derived risk classification]
    risk --> decision[Decision support]
    neural --> backend[FastAPI backend]
    decision --> backend
    backend --> frontend[React frontend]
    backend --> supabase[Optional Supabase history]
    backend --> testing[API and integration testing]
    frontend --> testing
    testing --> deployment[Local review demonstration]
    dataset -.->|binary Good/Bad; no timestamps| probability
    dataset -.->|deduplicate before split| preprocessing
